msgid "Changelog — v2"
msgstr "Changelog — v2"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.rst:6
msgid ""
"Every OpenMV firmware v2.x.x release brought new features and improvements. "
"Here's what changed in each one — including any breaking API changes and "
"exactly how to migrate your code. Releases are listed newest first; click a "
"version to open its changelog."
msgstr ""
"Setiap rilis firmware OpenMV v2.x.x menghadirkan fitur dan peningkatan baru."
" Berikut perubahan dalam setiap rilis — termasuk perubahan API yang tidak "
"kompatibel dan cara migrasi kode Anda. Rilis dicantumkan dari yang terbaru; "
"klik versi untuk membuka changelog-nya."

